# Firmware and microcode.
#
# Microcode is loaded by the bootloader before the kernel and fixes CPU errata;
# without it a machine can be subtly unstable in ways that look like software
# bugs. Both vendors are listed because the same configuration is used across
# Framework models with Intel and AMD boards, and the wrong one is simply unused.

linux-firmware
amd-ucode
intel-ucode

# Firmware updates from inside the installed system. Framework ships BIOS
# updates through LVFS, so this is the supported update path.
fwupd
